  "name": "SmartLead sheet sync: auto-capture client inquiries to Google Sheets",
  "description": "Capture client inquiries from any webform and send them straight into Google Sheets — automatically.  No code. No headaches.\n\n🚀 What It Does:\n\nSmartLead Sheet Sync is a plug-and-play automation that:\n\t•\tInstantly receives form submissions from your website or funnel via a webhook\n\t•\tExtracts and formats key info (like name, email, business name, message, timeline, budget)\n\t•\tLogs everything into a Google Sheet — in real time\n\nPerfect for freelancers, digital agencies, consultants, and productized service owners who want to stop copying/pasting leads manually.\n\n⸻\n\n⚙️ What You Get:\n\t•\tA pre-built 3-step automation (Webhook → Code → Google Sheet)\n\t•\tReady-to-use setup in n8n (free and open source automation tool)\n\t•\tClean, editable JavaScript code to format your incoming lead data\n\t•\tGoogle Sheet connection that logs every new inquiry in its own row",
